of -08, covering midnight to the next midnight. I think it’s worth searching for Dana, perhaps focusing on her budget as well. I’ll conduct a budget query and look into it, possibly even doing these searches in parallel. It seems efficient! I'll keep all this organized.\"}],\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABq8Soz5d828W7QbPrmgmo5gdjpB5qGiZJudtkag5134m2YrSMmG5GUkXDD6zaIh_rGK_zMVjzoYonht7gB-O3EmUPvU_ERWb5zvTHhxCpfMdekwuCJiUtEXkFol_4L7N9SXlOnekrIWitTAEQeGGWhZP6djDNgQGIairbTZeIpaBKC2t6fZxnbUwGJ0oSvEh7CsoQ9jmRWIwZa0aY5U1ZdhNS9sDjW7zL3gJ006zZuzozeLkp7sC6Lkg9ahIc5cPHXDoaJsuEVH8PgjsEAib1_OxWtrskryaVwlHkAFxGrhAIbFRdCklaRE9IlYZ5gFDT_B5lSklAuR-Ehwamhq7AZTFIdUNzLfKfpwfU7W-4OjvbD-ax0yEeTeNi2fmLoFfNq5NS4cuMed4h_UIjSRbKGBGtD4LYI7hUBbXC7KFP0DEOk-17VjUgKnlrheREud9agBZpLZw_IAa0f2kfBPliF1wVK0_ixjEV5MT-pViVXA-sDskAyyOcYsyfGuaErKEWqeAxMFvPFFdAJ0r5L0qjlhilrHlmMdA57n6MR4-D9gVi_YHDU6lacE4m7vSKMGdynD4myEBFbFEi1iniwoP0pg8bv3ld2XhlbLuO5UgHwqs-t_UHmnkihB_-Oq09yVGg9VSPP4DuN5A-EiGtsicdVvWe3i7ORn7smO9kRWJ9c8P0cdBtqPRutezPc1If3zc-HYxFqnqn2IJ24RCPXLWrzA6CV4Co0yABKb3xJmEpaW_98_lWDHVEViYjNLrZ5foa1VYavgOXcfMFd-mmieHYAiyzMvF52Z9RU2Ltg3HLIfJDUMreVaKyd1aL40xdJ4MwP3nLq9tJ8OSXCa-xoLRcXj5t80hoagy6M7rLzCaxb_0b6D3JCtRAjeLjAlmHqzTkxAtxHpXKJJ2m0EI-fDoUyxiuJPyhaI-F0HpCEKvMeSCujVeo5RQjToKqGlQr-ftMNBiNBZSgWmG71Ig8GiLpvhDVuyX4qGGdNk0XpgYHOcnlnmtlLEz7epQb4yB93ETr9Gm6_6BN1epWVgtbh6SJyeZ3uYBa20ohBFDRzPpBuKufFSq0yTO9hKGbEU71LrED7e7xnpEW6ySf3TEriLmdNlE20iLozWcOilBTAZTR1xIQ6WhxpHQplXwYbesMXOPcFsTdLJPj9fU6I0UjGZMlElgnObFiQTd9ujOq-n4wWF2R2L_Gnt70NpLrzusMcm-2S5ZOnSCMyKtFnQZpGovbF4VjODWDYPHsFPMkRbm5bmrKCKU_So8ZWqLuWd7hx0Lwocs_ki9dFNYnWFOKCnF81Yl0fe1v4NYmgYPqsojX0xorR_E091P_KMoF-Iq7E-dTqhLKyB6-wi5xJvlxxZH9Jyw9MNcO1hmenyXnD2ANH1o6vkIK4KRprQcucaKGnzRIxmoqxLI79yhwHNGmFXZOTFOX2s80teslbxnZpbqnQehhn9WdFESghKugh3ThfWuS57r31RWdZeZQPg_mQqDNocHzSRUlH22IJ2uiKPNfrCTJ8p46ijtQob45tVyN4TGlIhy9W9pFfBGDgQ-6-VWlWCp2BMLhAROnmsKPVthUBnQMJyl_Zw7UVlnYKib63We_awlXSSZTjlvbpxLNNAGk1BDAmoxPD9Rykus20586zgdtD87vEILpNfQou17fonNjr-BraEWUfWZ8YFt