re seems to be some confusion due to the email timestamp. So, I'll clarify for the user.\"}\n\nevent: response.reasoning_summary_part.done\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.reasoning_summary_part.done\",\"item_id\":\"rs_0c008018e11fdb7f016af12a49d5bc87d0a18e7cfdcd71cc6d\",\"output_index\":1,\"part\":{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Clarifying timezone confusion**\\n\\nI need to figure out the timezone issue since the system identifies time using UTC, not necessarily reflecting the user's calendar preference. My initial query with PST came up empty, but when I searched in UTC for November 9 and 10, I noticed events on November 10 that I didn't want. I have to confirm that for November 9, there are no upcoming events, but there seems to be some confusion due to the email timestamp. So, I'll clarify for the user.\"},\"sequence_number\":99,\"summary_index\":0}\n\nevent: response.reasoning_summary_part.added\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.reasoning_summary_part.added\",\"item_id\":\"rs_0c008018e11fdb7f016af12a49d5bc87d0a18e7cfdcd71cc6d\",\"output_index\":1,\"part\":{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"\"},\"sequence_number\":100,\"summary_index\":1}\n\nevent: response.reasoning_summary_text.delta\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.reasoning_summary_text.delta\",\"delta\":\"**Addressing scheduling discrepancies**\\n\\nIt's\",\"item_id\":\"rs_0c008018e11fdb7f016af12a49d5bc87d0a18e7cfdcd71cc6d\",\"obfuscation\":\"Epi\",\"output_index\":1,\"sequence_number\":101,\"summary_index\":1}\n\nevent: response.reasoning_summary_text.delta\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.reasoning_summary_text.delta\",\"delta\":\" important\",\"item_id\":\"rs_0c008018e11fdb7f016af12a49d5bc87d0a18e7cfdcd71cc6d\",\"obfuscation\":\"fFxxfc\",\"output_index\":1,\"sequence_number\":102,\"summary_index\":1}\n\nevent: response.reasoning_summary_text.delta\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.reasoning_summary_text.delta\",\"delta\":\" to\",\"item_id\":\"rs_0c008018e11fdb7f016af12a49d5bc87d0a18e7cfdcd71cc6d\",\"obfuscation\":\"qbe