tial confusion caused by Dana's email about bringing the budget sheet for the review, which is set for Nov 10 UTC, so I’ll include a message about this mismatch. I'll draft that message carefully.\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Confirming event timezone and date**\\n\\nOkay, so the calendar starts with a timezone field in UTC, which is good. I need to acknowledge the current date from the local system, confirming that tomorrow, Mon Nov 9, is indeed a Monday in 2026. Since the user is in the PST timezone, I should mention that I'm basing this on a Pacific OS environment. I've checked the command called to list the calendar events, and it came back empty. I'll finalize this with a concise draft confirmation.\"}]},\"output_index\":1,\"sequence_number\":299}\n\nevent: response.output_item.added\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.output_item.added\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"msg_0c008018e11fdb7f016af12a51184c87d0895e7762cf733b2e\",\"type\":\"message\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"content\":[],\"phase\":\"final_answer\",\"role\":\"assistant\"},\"output_index\":2,\"sequence_number\":300}\n\nevent: response.content_part.added\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.content_part.added\",\"content_index\":0,\"item_id\":\"msg_0c008018e11fdb7f016af12a51184c87d0895e7762cf733b2e\",\"output_index\":2,\"part\":{\"type\":\"output_text\",\"annotations\":[],\"logprobs\":[],\"text\":\"\"},\"sequence_number\":301}\n\nevent: response.output_text.delta\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.output_text.delta\",\"content_index\":0,\"delta\":\"-\",\"item_id\":\"msg_0c008018e11fdb7f016af12a51184c87d0895e7762cf733b2e\",\"logprobs\":[],\"obfuscation\":\"8Y7DrRF3ixqgNsq\",\"output_index\":2,\"sequence_number\":302}\n\nevent: response.output_text.delta\ndata: {\"type\":\"response.output_text.delta\",\"content_index\":0,\"delta\":\" **\",\"item_id\":\"msg_0c008018e11fdb7f016af12a51184c87d0895e7762cf733b2e\",\"logprobs\":[],\"obfuscation\":\"2uWzX5b3e7lQh\",\"output_index\":2,\"sequence_number\":303}\n\nevent: response.ou